{"id": 265, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:57", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:57", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/"}, "modified": "2026-10-07T18:20:41", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-07T18:20:41", "password": "", "slug": "bariatric-surgery", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/bariatric-surgery/", "title": {"raw": "Bariatric Surgery", "rendered": "Bariatric Surgery"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Bariatric (obesity) surgery can lead to substantial, lasting weight loss and improve weight-related health problems and quality of life. The right procedure depends on your health, your weight and your goals, and is chosen together with your surgeon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":329,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Nurse reviewing patient information on a tablet\" class=\"wp-image-329\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A supportive, respectful approach</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deciding on weight-loss surgery is a big step, and you do not have to take it alone. We take your health, your dignity and your well-being seriously and work with experienced teams who offer evidence-based treatment in a supportive, judgement-free setting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Weight-loss treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":330,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-sleeve-1024x917.jpg\" alt=\"Woman showing weight loss with oversized jeans\" class=\"wp-image-330\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Sleeve</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sleeve gastrectomy reduces the size of the stomach, which limits food intake and leads to significant, sustainable weight loss. One of the most widely performed weight-loss operations today.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":331,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-bypass-536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Waist measurement after weight loss\" class=\"wp-image-331\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Bypass</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most common form, the Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, reduces food intake and limits calorie absorption by changing the route of the digestive tract. A proven option for long-term weight loss.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":332,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-971x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with body outline, weight loss theme\" class=\"wp-image-332\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Balloon</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A non-surgical option: a soft, saline-filled balloon in the stomach creates a feeling of fullness and helps to reduce food intake. Depending on the system, it stays for several months. On average it leads to a weight loss of about 10% of body weight and is often a first step on the weight-loss journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your weight-loss treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Bariatric (obesity) surgery can lead to substantial, lasting weight loss and improve weight-related health problems and quality of life. The right procedure depends on your health, your weight and your goals, and is chosen together with your surgeon.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"968\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Nurse reviewing patient information on a tablet\" class=\"wp-image-329\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-1024x968.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-300x284.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-768x726.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-1536x1452.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery-13x12.jpg 13w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-surgery.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A supportive, respectful approach</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Deciding on weight-loss surgery is a big step, and you do not have to take it alone. We take your health, your dignity and your well-being seriously and work with experienced teams who offer evidence-based treatment in a supportive, judgement-free setting.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Weight-loss treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group m