ontent/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-bypass-768x1468.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-bypass-804x1536.jpg 804w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-bypass-6x12.jpg 6w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-bypass.jpg 837w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 536px) 100vw, 536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Bypass</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The most common form, the Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, reduces food intake and limits calorie absorption by changing the route of the digestive tract. A proven option for long-term weight loss.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"971\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-971x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with body outline, weight loss theme\" class=\"wp-image-332\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-971x1024.jpg 971w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-284x300.jpg 284w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-768x810.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon-11x12.jpg 11w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-bariatric-gastric-balloon.jpg 1278w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 971px) 100vw, 971px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gastric Balloon</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A non-surgical option: a soft, saline-filled balloon in the stomach creates a feeling of fullness and helps to reduce food intake. Depending on the system, it stays for several months. On average it leads to a weight loss of about 10% of body weight and is often a first step on the weight-loss journey.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrain